    "sub_name": "獨立研究(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INDEPENDENT STUDY(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是提供學生在指導教授的指導下，進行其研究性或實務性畢業論文的資料搜集與研究分析，並進行相關文獻與資料的搜集與整理，使學生得以在指導教授的定期指導下，能在修業年限內完成畢業論文的撰寫。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will provide students to conduct their dissertations under the directing of their supervisors.   Let the students could learn how search various data for their master’s thesis. Finally, could help students complete their master’s thesis on time.",
